t. Her most cherished glass house was hit by the stone she threw back at her! Hakozawa did not choose to remain silent. [2375] \"Yuki could not have done such a terrible thing. I cannot imagine her entering the cave at night, let alone strangling a big man like Ono, cutting off his ears, and even lifting the corpse onto a rock ledge\u2026\"\n[2376] \"It's not impossible,\" Taka's wife provoked. [2377] \"It's definitely impossible!\" [2378] Taka's wife shook her head, \"We have different opinions.\" [2379] The musician looked up at the ceiling, as if to say, \"Go ahead!\" [2380] \"Also, even though it's just a motive investigation, I hope you don't try to change the subject based on personal factors, saying things like 'it's impossible to lift the body.' I'm sorry! Yuki, I'm not saying it's you, but because Kamizono wants to claim that only we are the bad ones, I\u2026\"\n[2381] Upon hearing Zhezi's apology, Yuchi responded with a whispering voice, \"Yes.\" [2382] Hakamura frowned and twisted her lips. \"I don't know about the others. So, Ms. Tsukimi?\" [2383] \"Me?\" Tsukimi replied, looking at Zhezi. Her reaction was probably because she didn't understand why her name was brought up. [2384] \"You probably don't want to leave here either, but because of the arrogant and immature plan of Onizuka\u2026\"\n[2385] \"Enough, Zhezi?\" [2386] Kikyo's voice came like a flexible whip, making Yuki surprised and cover her mouth with her hand. \"I apologize.\" [2387] \"Do you think I could harm Kano just because I might be kicked out?\" [2388] When she mentioned \"me,\" Yuki placed her hand on her chest. Compared to Yuki, who was flushed with red, her action looked elegant. [2389] \"I didn't mean that. I just wanted to say that there are others besides our couple who oppose Kano's plan. See, Shido?\" [2390] Shido brushed aside his messy hair and widened his eyes. \"Now it's my turn?\" [2391] \"Well, I won't be polite. Elegant poet Kisu Shoji, what would happen if you were kicke