ounced it yet.\" [3261] \"I wonder what they're doing\u2026\"\n[3262] I suddenly became very worried about them. [3263] They must have never imagined that a murder case would happen in Mukumura village. [3264] As if to dispel the silence, Hakozaki started playing again. It was the \"Aquarium\" section of Saint-Sa\u00ebns' \"The Carnival of the Animals.\" [3265] 4\n[3266] There was still some time until lunch. I invited Kojima-sensei to the library, the room where we would meet again. It was a surprise to see him again. Since that night, I haven't chosen any books that I like to take back to my room. [3267] \"Although the collection here is not well-organized, it seems quite extensive,\" I asked for his opinion. [3268] Kojima-sensei was the first to enter this place. He nodded in agreement, \"Are these all the late Mochizuki Hikage's collection?\" [3269] \"Hmm, about eighty percent of them are. The remaining twenty percent are said to have been brought by the people who come here.\" [3270] There were many art books related to aesthetics. Almost all the sets were novels, poetry collections, and art criticism, while there were no commentaries on natural sciences or social sciences. From this point, it can be seen that this is a biased reader. Kojima-sensei and I began to browse the bookshelves slowly from both sides. [3271]I picked up a poetry collection by Beizhuan Baiqiu. The title \"The Fragrant Hunter\" caught my interest. [3272]I stood in front of the bookshelf, turning the pages one by one. Professor Jiang, who was walking towards me from the other direction, suddenly leaned over to look. His long hair hung over the edge of the page. We read silently for a while. [3273]The Fragrant Hunter\n[3274]The fragrance is subtle and pervasive. [3275]The flower buds burst out with a faint fragrance at the top. [3276] When the flowers bloom, the fragrance blooms with them. Only flowers that leave fragrance are appreciated...\n[3277] White roses bloom fragrantly even when the