or this person. [3296] Although it's lunch, the menu - curry - doesn't meet expectations. Despite having two to three days of stored food, temporarily far from the food shortage crisis, the cooking ingredients have become very limited. [3297] \"I think I've had curry recently.\" Qin Gui shrugged and casually said this sentence. [3298] \"The night before last, too.\" [3299] I said, and Jiang Shenji lifted his head, \"The night before last was when Masaya was in charge of cooking, right?\" [3300] I answered, \"Yeah!\" [3301] Jang Goda held a spoon in his right hand and stared at the plate without moving. [3302] \"Do you want to add anything?\" [3303] \"No.\" [3304] Why did he suddenly say that? I hadn't heard of such a thing, so I shook my head from side to side three and a half times. \"I'm sorry! I'm disturbing your meal,\" Jang Goda said to all the members gathered around the table, \"Could you please answer me one question? Is Mr. Onizuka's nose not very good? By \"not very good,\" I don't mean a disease like hay fever, but whether his sense of smell is quite dull. Does anyone know?\" [3305] Everyone stopped moving, and even some stopped chewing. After about five seconds of silence, the one who spoke was the person closest to Jang Goda - Kikuya. [3306] \"Why do you know that?\" [3307] \"Really?\" The dean leaned forward over the table with his hands on it. [3308] \"Yes, but why do you know? You've only been with him for a few minutes\u2026\"\n[3309] \"The dean must have known when I mentioned 'the dinner yesterday was curry'\u2026\" I gazed at the dean's profile. \"Is this related to Mr. Onizuka's nose?\" [3310] The dean explained calmly, \"Last night, I asked Makoto many things. I wanted to know the root of the crime, so I asked her to tell me what happened here before I came. I even heard about some trivial things. Makoto mentioned that yesterday, when she was preparing dinner, Mr. Onizuka approached her from behind and said, 'What are we having tonight?' while 