, \"No.\" Then the water spirit took out a silver axe and asked, \"Is this it?\" The woodcutter answered, \"No, not that either.\" Finally, the water spirit took out an old iron axe and asked, \"Is this it?\" The woodcutter nodded and said, \"Yes!\" 'You are commendable. You are upright! All these axes are yours.' The water spirit gave all three axes to the woodcutter. The woodcutter silently took the axes and held the golden axe in his right hand, using all his strength to hit the water spirit on the head with it and whispered to the water spirit, who was being hit by the axe and gradually sinking, \"Don't test me\u2026\"\n[1593] We pretended to be impressed and made a few humming sounds, but the poet honked the horn twice or three times, \"Hey, are you still awake? Smile! This is a joke I designed carefully!\" [1594] What? Just as I had this thought, there was a crazy laugh in the car, it was the poet, \"Laugh! Don't be fooled by the title of poet. Poetry lacks laughter. Only those who cannot make fun of themselves want to write poetry. Don't be fooled by those who not only want to throw you into the shit pit but also want to stomp on your head and make you sink! Don't be fooled by me!\" [1595] \"This guy must be on drugs,\" Oyama whispered into Matsushita's ear, but the voice was a bit too loud. [1596] \"You said I was on drugs?\" Shizu suppressed his laughter and tilted his head to look at Oshima, \"No, that's something people do. It's something that ordinary people who want to land a helicopter on the top of Mount Fuji and plant a flag would do. Even if I know someone who takes drugs, I would feel sorry for them and not blame them. It's just that I feel sorry for them...\"\n[1597] \"So there's no drugs in the village of Kumano?\" Oshima's choice of words and Matsukata's were very different, and there seemed to be a slight hostility towards the poet. \"No. You saw the exquisite herb garden inside, didn't you? We also have ginseng fields, taro, onions, and ginger